PWA icon note
=============

The app icon source is icon.svg in this folder.

vite-plugin-pwa requires PNG icons at 192x192 and 512x512 referenced from the
generated manifest (see vite.config.ts). This build ships icon.svg as the
source asset; before publishing to a host that requires strict PWA
installability, convert it once to PNG:

  # with ImageMagick
  magick icon.svg -resize 192x192 icon-192.png
  magick icon.svg -resize 512x512 icon-512.png

and place icon-192.png / icon-512.png in public/icons/.

Verification status: manifest generation is configured and expected from
`npm run build`; PNG conversion and real-device install were NOT verified in
this environment (no local shell available). See DEVELOPMENT_STATUS.md.
